{%- comment -%}
  Section: ds-lp-brands-keilhauer
  Purpose: Keilhauer brand/dealer landing page — Brant Business Interiors is the AUTHORIZED
           DEALER (not the manufacturer). Keilhauer IS a Canadian manufacturer of commercial
           seating (made in Toronto, ON since 1981) — the Made-in-Canada / maple-leaf accent is
           CORRECT here. Company/line level only — Keilhauer is NOT in data/specs.json and has
           zero live SKUs (quote-only carried line), so NO model specs, dimensions, or weight
           capacities. Quote-led framing: the browse tiles point at generic boardroom/seating/
           lounge collections, not Keilhauer-specific collections.
  Used by: page.brands-keilhauer.json (template suffix: brands-keilhauer)
  Schema: Brand (distinct @id) + Service (provider → #organization) + FAQPage (blocks).
          Honest-dealer pattern (SCHEMA-BRAND-1 / SCHEMA-CRIT-1) — Brand node may name Keilhauer
          as the manufacturer (true); Service node = Brant Business Interiors as dealer only.
          NO parentOrganization, NO BBI-manufactures implication, NO OECM agreement number on the
          Service node. FAQ visible accordion byte-matches the FAQPage list.
  OECM: buyer-level hedge only (no product-level eligibility / no Agreement-number-as-claim).
  Warranty: verified against Keilhauer's published Warranty Policy (2023-05-23) — standard
            single-shift use (≤40 hrs/wk): desk, conference & task chairs 10 yr; lounge seating
            10 yr; tables/shelves/carts 10 yr; textiles 1 yr; heavy use (>40 hrs/wk) furniture
            5 yr. This is WHOLE-PRODUCT coverage against defects in materials/workmanship — NOT
            "structural components only" (prior copy under-stated it). NO superlative.
  Location: Keilhauer manufactures in Toronto, ON (1450 Birchmount Rd) — naming the city is
            verified and correct.
  De-confliction: BRAND lane only — owns "keilhauer / keilhauer dealer". Links to (never restates)
            the LIVE keilhauer-vs-ergocentric-seating comparison. Does NOT link
            keilhauer-vs-global-office-seating-ontario (DRAFT / 404, not live).
  Gate: theme.liquid bbi_landing gate — suppresses Starlite header/footer/cart
{%- endcomment -%}

