  <section class="lp-intro" aria-label="About Keilhauer">
    <div class="lp-intro__inner">
      <p class="lp-intro__eyebrow bbi-mono">About Keilhauer</p>
      <h2>Is Brant Business Interiors a Keilhauer dealer?</h2>
      <div class="lp-intro__body">
        <p>Yes &mdash; Brant Business Interiors is an authorized Keilhauer dealer serving Ontario. Keilhauer is a Canadian manufacturer that has built commercial seating in Toronto since 1981, with a catalogue spanning high-specification boardroom and conference chairs, lounge seating for reception and common areas, task seating, and tables. Through our dealer account we supply, quote, deliver, and install the Keilhauer lines we carry for institutional and workplace clients across the province.</p>
        <p>As an authorized dealer we can quote across the Keilhauer catalogue, including custom upholstery, COM (customer&rsquo;s own material) programs, and CAD/BIM blocks for your space plan. Keilhauer warrants its products against defects in materials and workmanship for 10 years under standard single-shift use &mdash; covering desk, conference and task chairs, lounge seating, and tables, with textiles warranted for 1 year. Because every chair is built to order, we confirm current model availability, fabric and finish, and lead time before your purchase order is issued.</p>
        <p>As a multi-line contract dealer supplying Ontario workplaces since 1964, we handle Keilhauer alongside the rest of your fit-out &mdash; seating, desking, storage, and tables &mdash; on a single quote, with delivery and installation by our own Ontario team.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

